# Keep the build context small and deterministic. The build stage runs `npm ci`,
# `npm run build`, `npm test` and `npm pack`, so it needs source, tests, examples,
# templates, eval fixtures and docs — but not derived or local-only artifacts.

node_modules
.git
dist
eval/.fixture
docs/media

# Derived state. `examples/vault/.circadia/triples/` is NOT derived — it is a tracked
# cache that `test/integration.test.ts` reads ("hipporag note loads cached triples") — so
# it is deliberately kept. Excluding all `.circadia/` folders breaks the build-stage
# `npm test`; only the derived artifacts are excluded here.
**/.circadia/index.sqlite*
**/.circadia/dreams/
**/.circadia/access.jsonl
**/.circadia/consolidated.json
